# 在支持 .http 的工具中替换变量；密钥通过工具的私密环境注入。
@baseUrl = https://mail.example.com:8443
@apiKey = po_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_KEY
@mailbox = alice@example.com
@messageId = 123

### mail:read — 查询摘要
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages?email={{mailbox}}&folder=inbox&page=1&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### management — 读完整正文（不会自动标为已读）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/manage/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### mail:send — 发送；运行前核对 from/to 和正文
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/send
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"alice@example.com","to":["bob@example.com"],"subject":"会议确认","text":"请确认明天下午三点的会议。"}

### management — 标记已读
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/manage/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"read":true}

### management — 域名和邮箱配额
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/manage/domains
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### management — 查询邮箱账号（不是查邮件）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/manage/accounts?domain=example.com&page=1&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
